    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748970/extras/e54670a4fd304b610054e3b27faf342a.poster.avif?t=1680733940\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748970/extras/e54670a4fd304b610054e3b27faf342a.webm?t=1680733940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748970/extras/e54670a4fd304b610054e3b27faf342a.mp4?t=1680733940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description</h2>Extinction is a short but immersive singleplayer horror game where you play as a young traveler who is exploring an abandoned valley called &quot;The valley of Extinction. Your role is to explore different places in the valley of Extinction such as a deep, dark forest and an old basement. In these places you will find different possessed monsters who want to kill you. Trying to survive will soon be in your best interest...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2>Extinction contains a linear singleplayer horror experience, in which you will solve different puzzles, explore different, haunted places and most importantly try to survive.<br><br>(USE HEADPHONES FOR BEST EXPERIENCE)<br>(Warning : Game contains some gore.)<br><br>If you are having trouble with the install then you probably need to download visual c++ redistributable, you can do that in this link <br><br>IMPORTANT : if game is not working properly when started then you need to wait untill it loads and dont click on it as it may cause it to crash, if movement is unresponsive then press &quot;escape&quot; button and click on continue.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748970/extras/e54670a4fd304b610054e3b27faf342a.poster.avif?t=1680733940\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748970/extras/e54670a4fd304b610054e3b27faf342a.webm?t=1680733940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748970/extras/e54670a4fd304b610054e3b27faf342a.mp4?t=1680733940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description</h2>Extinction is a short but immersive singleplayer horror game where you play as a young traveler who is exploring an abandoned valley called &quot;The valley of Extinction. Your role is to explore different places in the valley of Extinction such as a deep, dark forest and an old basement. In these places you will find different possessed monsters who want to kill you. Trying to survive will soon be in your best interest...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2>Extinction contains a linear singleplayer horror experience, in which you will solve different puzzles, explore different, haunted places and most importantly try to survive.<br><br>(USE HEADPHONES FOR BEST EXPERIENCE)<br>(Warning : Game contains some gore.)<br><br>If you are having trouble with the install then you probably need to download visual c++ redistributable, you can do that in this link <br><br>IMPORTANT : if game is not working properly when started then you need to wait untill it loads and dont click on it as it may cause it to crash, if movement is unresponsive then press &quot;escape&quot; button and click on continue.",
